OL,3,AK-pop star convicted of violating
OL,4,Amilitary service law
OL,5,
OL,6,FA South Korean court has handed a
OL,7,Fsuspended one-year prison sentence to
OL,8,FK-pop singer Song Min-ho after he was
OL,9,Fconvicted of violating the country's
OL,10,Fmilitary service law.
OL,12,FThe 33-year-old member of the boy band
OL,13,FWinner was found to have been absent
OL,14,Fmultiple times at a community centre in
OL,15,FSeoul, where he had worked as a social
OL,16,Fworker from 2023 to 2024.
OL,18,FAll able-bodied men in South Korea have
OL,19,Fto serve at least 18 months in the
OL,20,Fmilitary. But some are alternatively
OL,21,Fassigned as social service personnel
OL,22,Ffor health reasons.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
