OL,3,AK-pop star convicted of violating
OL,4,Amilitary service law
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prison sentence handed on Thursday
OL,7,Fis suspended for two years. That means
OL,8,Fhe can avoid incarceration if he does
OL,9,Fnot commit any crime during that
OL,10,Ftwo-year probationary period.
